#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Commands:** The ``-h`` option for the ``routes`` command is renamed to "
"``--sort-by-handler`` to avoid conflict with the common use of ``-h`` as "
"a shortcut for ``--help``. The old ``-h`` option will continue to work "
"until v4.8.0, at which point it will be removed and repurposed as a "
"shortcut for ``--help``. A warning message is displayed when using the "
"old ``-h`` option to encourage users to switch to the new ``--sort-by-"
"handler`` option."
msgstr ""

