msgid "Deprecations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:37
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Autoloader:** Fixed a bug where ``Autoloader::unregister()`` (used "
"during tests) silently failed to remove handlers from the SPL autoload "
"stack, causing closures to accumulate permanently."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:40
msgid ""
"**CLI:** Fixed a bug where ``CLI::generateDimensions()`` leaked ``stty`` "
"error output (e.g., ``stty: 'standard input': Inappropriate ioctl for "
"device``) to stderr when stdin was not a TTY."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:41
msgid ""
"**CLI:** Fixed a bug where ``CLI::generateDimensions()`` leaked ``tput`` "
"error output (``tput: No value for $TERM and no -T specified``) to stderr"
" when the ``stty`` fallback was reached and the ``TERM`` environment "
"variable was not set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Commands:** Fixed a bug in the ``env`` command where passing options "
"only would cause the command to throw a ``TypeError`` instead of showing "
"the current environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Commands:** Fixed a bug in ``key:generate`` command where the regex "
"used to locate the ``encryption.key`` line was fooled by a comment "
"containing the substring (silently writing nothing), and did not handle "
"DotEnv's ``export encryption.key = ...`` syntax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Common:** Fixed a bug where the ``command()`` helper function did not "
"properly clean up output buffers, which could lead to risky tests when "
"exceptions were thrown."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Database:** Fixed a bug where ``BaseConnection::listTables()`` could "
"return a sparse array when using cached table names after a table was "
"dropped."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Database:** Fixed a bug where the PostgreSQL driver's ``increment()`` "
"and ``decrement()`` methods were not working for numeric columns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Database:** Fixed a bug where the SQLSRV driver's decrement method was "
"adding instead of subtracting the decrement value when ``$castTextToInt``"
" was false."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Entity:** Fixed a bug where ``Entity::normalizeValue()`` did not handle"
" ``UnitEnum`` before checking for ``toArray()``, causing enums "
"implementing ``toArray()`` to be incorrectly normalized as generic "
"objects instead of enums."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Kint:** Fixed a bug where stale Content Security Policy nonces were "
"reused in worker mode, causing browser CSP violations for Debug Toolbar "
"assets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Language:** Fixed a bug where ``Language::getLine()`` returned the "
"literal dot-notation key instead of the nested array value when the "
"requested key resolved to an intermediate array three or more levels "
"deep."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Toolbar:** Fixed a bug where the Logs collector raised an undefined "
"property error when using a third-party PSR-3 logger."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Time:** Fixed a bug where ``Time::createFromTimestamp()`` could fail "
"for microsecond timestamps when ``LC_NUMERIC`` used a comma decimal "
"separator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Validation:** Fixed a bug where ``Validation::getValidated()`` dropped "
"fields whose validated value was explicitly ``null``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.3.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Worker Mode:** Fixed a bug where the ``frankenphp-worker.php`` template"
" caused a ``Cannot redeclare class Config\\Paths`` fatal error when "
"FrankenPHP's watcher re-executed the worker script after a watched file "
"changed."
msgstr ""

